record.content:
The quadratic equation 


\begin{equation}
r = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}
\end{equation}

can be used to find the solutions (roots) to a second order polynomial

$$ax^2 + bx + c = 0$$
